<title>SOUTH KOREA: TENNIS-S.KOREA DEFEAT JAPAN 3-2 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-S.KOREA DEFEAT JAPAN 3-2 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-02-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea beat Japan 3-2 in their Davis Cup tennis Asia/Oceania zone group one first round tie after winning both reverse singles on Sunday.</p>
<p>Results:</p>
<p>Yoon Yong-il beat Shuzo Matsuoka 6-2 6-4 6-3.</p>
<p>Lee Hyung-taek beat Takao Suzuki 3-6 6-4 1-6 6-4 6-4.</p>
